  "display_help": "While toggled on, this power provides a small boost in Damage, Defense(Melee, AoE, Smashing, Lethal, Energy, Negative, Fire, Cold), and Special to all leaguemates within a 50 foot radius.  Up to five Support Hybrid powers can stack on a single target at any given time.  This boost is doubled in strength for pets.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Endurance Discount at all times.",
